# Popover

Popover displays contextual controls next to a trigger. It uses a portal, follows its trigger during scrolling, flips when space is constrained, and closes on Escape or outside interaction. Use `align="start"`, `align="center"`, or `align="end"` to position the panel along its trigger.

Set `openOnHover` to open from a mouse hover. `openDelay` and `closeDelay` control intent timing, while a grace area keeps the panel open as the pointer moves between the trigger and content. Clicking the trigger or interacting with the content pins the popover until an explicit dismissal.

